{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:57c49cfb120b730c2f14b3292be00d77c5abf136588fea85ec43d9520ab70f91",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61f293bfae675dd8eafc6506f8de0b8fe63cc2ac740715143b388e9bfa825a86",
      "text": "蛋糕带来的相遇",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99a91b10dcfa73c9fd1d1deab929965a40210e6ec29b46c3b93158678453e0ee",
      "text": "杂志拍摄结束后，回到事务所的\n卷绪和制作人。制作人一边歇口气，\n一边询问起因工作和练习增加而看似忙碌的\n卷绪的现状。卷绪以“像社团活动一样开心”\n为切入点聊了起来……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61f293bfae675dd8eafc6506f8de0b8fe63cc2ac740715143b388e9bfa825a86",
      "text": "蛋糕带来的相遇",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8960bc1766cb8aa140c01808f87a882d45e09baad68f3635c28a41df4d105aa3",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n让您久等了。我把行李拿过来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4609ab1377488a34d170034ee81b2599eb918044975691cbaa4a789ad1e170c9",
      "text": "不用着急的。我也是刚刚才跟各位\n打完招呼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db2418010b28979783b2d35d2ec856a33abe5a4f0c712e8d0bb0c168b4a4c95e",
      "text": "今天的工作就到此结束了。\n如果您打算直接回家的话，要一起去车站吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38a50b5fe2df9343a916f0072cdfb38039798a5ca2d776fcff52168050b92b6f",
      "text": "我打算之后顺道去一趟事务所。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccde90954f92851ba97d9c1f3f7a41d3a25a9dfb30beb7f9bcaa0092d4bb7fc7",
      "text": "制作人要是也回事务所的话，\n要不要一起走？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffe8ffde0daf48b005b6deb6988de4eaa4408b4a542f1d590e4b99fe54cd031d",
      "text": "我也正有此意，务必一起。到了事务所之后，\n要是您有时间的话，要稍微聊聊吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0265d6449b0b974a6984b2ebdbd42bad5001ace9c7723e4b90d1891553cca17",
      "text": "诶，可以吗。我也正好想跟制作人\n聊聊呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9204df195105031e8a2d13fe4dfb245770ab882a146a55831a93de4580c8769",
      "text": "原来是这样啊。能问您一声\n真是太好了！那我们回去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:393b1b6c53e476fa9fbae85070babbfb42eb7edc048bd26d25d0e1b339416386",
      "text": "好的！啊，在那之前！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f3d4497ba4c2a7c23930a8e01444329c85027ed1273158bc79eedcae71dcc18",
      "text": "各位，辛苦大家了！\n我先失陪了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_b:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c13fc231201671a399b2260b5e43e994a7110309da8ecc7db4768c05fce7202",
      "text": "卷绪先生，我准备了饮品。\n请用。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6c0c3d3435715382c6b2d7cb0ef52a2d42968894af2afead4e101366e65cfba",
      "text": "哇，非常感谢！\n……那我开动了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9c1cc9d4bd07cfd43453e02142fa26cddb392c10ffa03ef732b5e957dd50ddd",
      "text": "现场没能好好问您，\n今天的拍摄感觉怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c7a42b470fa1f3eb69bdbfa25ce9cae16a3be8b6b266d731dca87cc5ca81e87",
      "text": "非常开心！\n感觉时间一下子就过去了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6071f4b50aed40757415627de6936401a1730f92cd2f15c58662895079624c77",
      "text": "工作人员们都非常随和，\n我们聊了好多话题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fac9219a0e7036a7b9df859bd0e810f53c08696e31953619401fe6b6932c143",
      "text": "我们聊最喜欢哪种蛋糕聊得很尽兴呢。\n大家分成了海绵蛋糕派和水果挞派，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2cf9ecc6ef2ae920ee2852082d2b445ec0f71f1efa73604128a90e1827d214b",
      "text": "还互相推荐了各自看好的店铺。多亏聊了那些，\n我完全没有紧张就投入到拍摄中了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2f419730b4b6026351133305d7a842ac53d24c0861f82b6f7952758b29fa71a",
      "text": "聊起蛋糕话题时的卷绪先生，\n看起来特别开心、充满活力呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6279e5df079885c91f14a62882b7bc406fa8b808e94f67b34b0c2c5875185d51",
      "text": "摄影师也说，看到那个表情之后，\n拍摄的构思就变得更加清晰了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:426616e8c04bf0c48fc8dbdd39a0d8c94e40111a7f351c82d6acf766e8c2a316",
      "text": "原来您和摄影师聊了这些啊。\n能帮上忙，我好开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_c:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:834694fae3b676db0d0b80b799451a852060f540078b24c82f9d45fb9be0943e",
      "text": "换个话题，随着偶像工作的增加，\n因工作和练习而变晚的日子也变多了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_c:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a952774a2014162db5a5c2d82b1235e45ed0d394fc7c902b6384a34ff65aa77f",
      "text": "虽然我一直在调整日程以免影响到您的学业，\n但要是有什么情况，请立刻告诉我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_c:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d790796ac32ed3565832a01e74b63c3ead40e6d382e83a7674f5344237653ea",
      "text": "谢谢您！虽然有时也会觉得稍微有点辛苦，\n但像社团活动一样，每天都非常开心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10ef5a844eef67fff46420dde396568ee5208b0542acd305a44d8a4b05784b4d",
      "text": "社团活动吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9709f16025cc564696524bc031c289e35023bb65c6d709f091e5c8af0b7852b9",
      "text": "是的。这是我自己的感觉，和大家朝着同一个\n目标前进的感觉很像社团活动呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba3c0e4c641f0e09d419959f43fae73ab726d943690b73b8d0111935e633f1a4",
      "text": "因为父亲经常调动工作，\n我其实从来没有参加过社团活动呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:676831c0504cc124e296756f3670aede685ccba14c18aa6792d5805b101710d1",
      "text": "常常在交到真正算得上朋友的人之前就离开了那个城市，\n所以也可以说是没能加入吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e91d0fbcd0b20d6e22cf56137214c6d106fc6bbe3e59aeba264e96c76da3152d",
      "text": "虽然对离别还是习惯不了，不过频繁搬家的生活\n我觉得倒也没那么糟糕哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1ac316f58f4618172c4ddfc4413b538971ebb94a71155844946552c24c0fce2",
      "text": "能吃到各个地方的名点心，\n而且我沉迷的咖啡店巡礼也进展得很顺利。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f3e0a0dc915da92eaa6ebac0220aec5fecf29303c8a1b2f6d1569363ca3f3e1",
      "text": "而且，能与Cafe Parade这家店相遇，\n也是多亏了父亲的工作调动。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_d:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7b3df9fa41296bc097c0b6c76246f5664339f7e5754f6087cb1a33001ceb031",
      "text": "在我寻找着命运般的蛋糕时，\n被蛋糕的香气吸引而走进去的正是这家店呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff0121a71965eb668e284f8024281d0e56aef174690cfa18197834cbd3419212",
      "text": "吃到庄一郎先生的蛋糕时真的太震撼了。\n每一样都那么美味，我把那天的蛋糕全吃了个遍！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c50128dcdf2ee389425d63a132e833b93bfaf6dfea9ff5d5fdac013ab4c9a827",
      "text": "之后我就开始常去那家店，过了一阵子\n就在那里当兼职员工了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_d:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4811c76939509eef7ec84d6d2346363db52ebada21c745815453d0835c8952ea",
      "text": "原来如此，和Cafe Parade的相遇\n是以庄一郎先生的蛋糕为契机啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb4270559f08b1902a204281c35127252efc3c0031a1176ac79ab50e2c09e658",
      "text": "是的！而且配着神谷先生泡的红茶一起吃蛋糕，\n简直棒极了。两者的搭配真的极其绝妙。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41de0e1ee37f0c77a0ed4606f4b96e697f4cde03ed837a0f30afe92646fcf62b",
      "text": "阿斯兰先生做的料理也道道\n都美味，而且他非常努力呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8492d1402fc1ae7f3384380b79e3397dd8dfb90f6b9dd44c43ee4b85cd956c3a",
      "text": "做出绝品蛋糕的庄一郎先生，\n我在心里一直把他当作师父。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c7d3e548386e8c8a1a40aac18d2ee320cab3f25abe25410c7b32a72a4e00064",
      "text": "还交到了叫做咲酱的\n重要朋友。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68fbe38309cc570a273d826fc3157fa72afd6c9b628ab6d4a8b72cee31c44912",
      "text": "然后，能够遇到●●●●プロデューサー，\n也是多亏了频繁搬家。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fca0c60a004f4fc60f4b221199054a50bee1c41e2274a75650ab94be6bb4ab91",
      "text": "得到了制作人的邀请，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:643e67c3fbe24e784668bb1124fbabce93e601a17e2505b2cef73cbe37e50590",
      "text": "作为偶像在Cafe Parade活动之后，\n感觉就像社团活动一样，每天都很充实！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_e:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae937320a11004dc80f8ae04183dfc51f54a905adb3f068dcffa5852818283a0",
      "text": "这样啊。能够再次听到卷绪先生过着\n充实的日子，真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_e:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:943b5404d1bad9509cab1a7cabc2fa662fff86e7a2733c6a87c56275e73b8654",
      "text": "今后也请多多关照了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_e:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d2f254d4d76043dd03027aeaf79d65588973b62b55b2f486eb8bb68abe644de",
      "text": "好的，我这边才要请您多多关照。今后作为偶像，\n我也会超努力完成很多工作的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba8a5343bf8967fc96fa092bbf525599911539911cea2588b745ec9c26e5d980",
      "text": "工作之后吃到的蛋糕味道格外特别呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3e097db1637534557809f073ce10a18947430be325041fa031a910ae302e413",
      "text": "这是成为偶像之后才增加的\n享受蛋糕的新方式。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_e:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecd3aa8547e9dae62c39503c533836bb9537d4c323896aa451f6ab15e288fb07",
      "text": "那么下次卷绪先生工作结束后，\n我就去买好吃的蛋糕回来吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_e:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1fba022f806e0c6842695264a8e7ad7e0a77fba02d59537ac287454383929b05",
      "text": "谢谢您！\n下次工作结束后，我会好好期待的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4a5579095ee5aa71f10321a62ad30be972b86248b037d0d9fa78492820cb0f0",
      "text": "到时候制作人\n也一起吃吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_030mak_01_1_2_030_01:1_2_030_01_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3265e93de2e598f2cf5119e6202cf2afb743954528712e6700ae2e51c109f21d",
      "text": "一起努力的●●●●プロデューサー，\n也一定会觉得蛋糕格外美味的！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
